#: ../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/custom_modules.rst:228
msgid "**生成自定义环境（扩展技能）**"
msgstr "**Generating Custom Environments (Extension Skill)**"

#: ../../../data2/home/huanghaoyu/AgentSociety/agentsociety2/agentsociety/packages/agentsociety2/docs/custom_modules.rst:220
msgid ""
"自定义环境的生成流程不走后端 HTTP，而是由扩展内置的 Claude Code 技能 ``agentsociety-create-env-module`` 驱动：经 intake → "
"clarify → design → generate → validate 五个 stage（``stages/``）推进，并由 ``scripts/validate.py`` 做 "
"scanner / tester / registry 端到端校验。运行产物（需求、设计、``validation_report.json`` 等）落在工作区的 "
"``.agentsociety/custom_env_skill/runs/<run_id>/`` 下。"
msgstr ""
"Custom environment generation does not go through the backend HTTP API; it is driven by the "
"Claude Code skill ``agentsociety-create-env-module`` built into the extension. It advances "
"through five stages (``stages/``) — intake → clarify → design → generate → validate — and "
"``scripts/validate.py`` performs end-to-end scanner / tester / registry validation. Run artifacts"
" (requirements, design, ``validation_report.json``, etc.) land under "
"``.agentsociety/custom_env_skill/runs/<run_id>/`` in the workspace."

